# Google Drive backup — public OAuth client id (safe to expose; inlined at build time).
# Unset → the Drive feature is hidden and the app is unchanged.
# Get one: console.cloud.google.com → enable Drive API → OAuth consent (scope drive.file) →
# Credentials → OAuth client ID (Web) → add your origins to Authorized JavaScript origins.
# Copy to .env.local for dev; set in the Vercel project env + redeploy for prod.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
